        "created_at": "2014-06-11T18:59:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Temporary tokens are only when an ability explicitly days “temporary.” If it doesn’t,  its permanent.</p>\n<p>If a card says to gain Energy,  In goes on the SF panel. These are not permanent,  unless it explicitly says so.</p>",
