      {
        "id": 106421,
        "name": "Ixcelbrien",
        "username": "Ixcelbrien",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/i/4af34b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-12-29T16:21:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Can you clarify this? Just got this for Christmas. Really enjoy it. But don't understand this statement.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Do do you mean it will tell you if it is temporary. If it doesn't it goes on your ship panel as extra energy until its gone?&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For example: you have 4 normal defense and 2 weaponry but you have two extra weaponry due to a card boost. You remove from defense to weaponry, outside in, then you you remove from your ship. Is that when it would come into play as far as removal but until then it is helping boost your stats?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If it was specifically temporary then you would remove it in the aftermath.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>lol tell me where I've messed up.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:36:19.560Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
